[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6061.91, "timestamp": "01:41:01", "text": "你…我不知道會怎麼樣，因為我的環境…我以前是工作環境，所以一定跟你的環境不一樣。所以有時候像學生環境會比較輕鬆，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6064.95, "timestamp": "01:41:04", "text": "他們不會讓你多喝酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6066.709, "timestamp": "01:41:06", "text": "。  但在工作環境中，總得有人陪同。所以，我喜歡你，你不是，你不是，你說你必須陪同，但因為我是唯一一個"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6074.037, "timestamp": "01:41:14", "author": "@vinzidcreator", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/6N6hlttqAPJW-h4WV0cWFHqds0lBhXYYguTso6VNcwcD9Pl0uHdL7RphVieFjKCvwzUnqOh1=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "saiko is amateur alcoholic "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6074.39, "timestamp": "01:41:14", "text": "喝酒的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6083.75, "timestamp": "01:41:23", "text": "。所以感覺好像非喝不可。所以為了佐餐，我就那樣喝著薩喬酒。但是，如果你現在就想喝啤酒的話，它們非常清淡。所以，與印度啤酒相比，你不必擔心會很快醉酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6086.07, "timestamp": "01:41:26", "text": "。它很輕。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6089.18, "timestamp": "01:41:29", "author": "@gaurdiangaming4603", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mFiZLBZWkzinaMdP6tEYkP1j69A0G3jL01PKtnzXI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I think most people are soft to alcohol. I drink vodka regularly. so beer is practically water to me."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6108.709, "timestamp": "01:41:48", "text": "啤酒，尤其是明奇啤酒，就沒有那種感覺。如果"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6108.94, "timestamp": "01:41:48", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lemondou?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6111.27, "timestamp": "01:41:51", "text": "你只想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6113.109, "timestamp": "01:41:53", "text": "喝便宜的啤酒，可以直接去便利商店，你會發現各種口味的啤酒，簡直糟透了。  我哭了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6119.669, "timestamp": "01:41:59", "text": "因為我喜歡啤酒。我不喜歡啤酒的混合味道，除非它是葡萄酒啤酒。  所以我去了那裡。我喝了這款"}]